Prompt
Use the uploaded user photo as the ONLY and EXCLUSIVE identity reference for the character in the final image.

The final result must clearly and unmistakably depict the exact same person from the uploaded photo.

IDENTITY PRESERVATION IS THE HIGHEST PRIORITY.

STRICT IDENTITY PRESERVATION

Preserve exactly:
- facial identity
- gender
- skin tone
- ethnicity
- age impression
- face shape
- forehead
- eyebrows
- eye shape and eye color
- nose
- lips
- cheekbones
- jawline
- chin
